https://www.scholarships.net.in/64848.html,"Organisation: Indian School of Hospitality (ISH) & Buddy4StudyScholarship Name: Admission Scholarship Program 2026-27Applicable For: Applicants seeking admission to the B.Sc. in Global Business & Entrepreneurial Leadership program.Scholarship Amount: 100% Tuition Fee Scholarship & Placement AssistanceLast Date: 29th July 2026Website:https://www.buddy4study.com/page/indian-school-of-hospitality-ish-admission-scholarship-program

Table of Contents

The Indian School of Hospitality (ISH) Admission Scholarship Program 2026-27, launched in collaboration with Buddy4Study, provides deserving and ambitious students with the opportunity to pursue a world-class undergraduate education at Indian School of Hospitality (ISH). By offering a 100% tuition fee waiver on the eligible course, ISH empowers talented students from diverse socio-economic backgrounds to pursue careers in one of the world’s fastest-growing industries, with the added assurance of 100% placement assistance upon successful completion of the program. Last date of application is 29th July 2026.

Related / Similar Scholarship:Luxury Connect Business School Scholarship 2026-27

** Applicants must be willing to seek admission to the B.Sc. in Global Business & Entrepreneurial Leadership program.** Applicants must have passed Class 12 with 70% marks or above.** Candidates from any academic stream (Science, Commerce, Arts/Humanities) may apply; however, having Mathematics as a subject in Class 12 is mandatory.** Applicants must submit their SAT scores or take the ISH Aptitude Test.** As the course and all communication are conducted in English, applicants must have a good working command of the English language.** Students with a genuine interest in hospitality, business, entrepreneurship, retail, travel, or related sectors are especially encouraged to apply.

** Selected students receive two significant benefits that reduce both the financial burden and career uncertainty associated with higher education.** 100% tuition fee scholarship: Full tuition fee waiver for the B.Sc. in Global Business & Entrepreneurial Leadership (GBEL) program.** 100% placement assistance: Upon successful completion of the course, every student will receive 100% placement assistance.

To apply for Indian School of Hospitality Admission Scholarship, Follow the below steps

Steps:** Go to the link given above and Click on the ‘Show Interest’ button.** Register or log in to Buddy4Study to continue to the ‘Indian School of Hospitality (ISH) Admission Scholarship Program 2026-27’ interest form page.** Fill in the required details in the online interest form and upload relevant documents.** Review all the details carefully, then click on the ‘Submit’ button to submit your interest form.

Applicants must submit valid and clear digital copies of the following:** Passport-size photograph (recent, formal)** Proof of identity: Masked Aadhaar Card, Passport, Voter ID, Driving Licence, or any valid government-issued photo ID** Class 10 mark sheet** Class 12 mark sheet and passing certificate (or provisional, if appearing)** Income certificate issued by a competent government authority

Last Date of Indian School of Hospitality Admission Scholarship is 29th July 2026.Author : Jency

