https://www.scholarships.net.in/64834.html,"Organisation: Hero FinCorpScholarship Name: Raman Kant Munjal Scholarship 2026-27Applicable For: Students currently in their first year of various programsScholarship Amount: Scholarship upto INR 5,50,000 per year for three yearsLast Date: 31st August 2026Website:https://www.buddy4study.com/page/raman-kant-munjal-scholarships

Table of Contents

The Raman Kant Munjal Scholarship for 2026-27, initiated by the Raman Kant Munjal Foundation and supported by Hero FinCorp, is designed to assist students in finance-related fields in achieving their career aspirations. This scholarship offers financial support of up to INR 5,50,000 per year for three years to students currently in their first year of various programs, including BBA, BFIA, B.Com (H, E), Bachelor of Management Studies (BMS), Integrated Program in Management (IPM), B.A. (Economics), and Bachelor in Business Studies (BBS), among other finance-related degrees. Last date of application is 31st August 2026.

** Open to students across India currently enrolled in the first year of BBA, BFIA, B.Com (H, E), Bachelor of Management Studies (BMS), Integrated Program in Management (IPM), B.A. (Economics), Bachelor in Business Studies (BBS), or any other finance-related degree course.** Applicants must have secured at least 80% marks in Classes 10 and 12 (For PwD students, the minimum percentage required is 70% marks).** The annual parental income of the applicant must not exceed INR 6 lakh from all sources.** Open for Indian nationals only.** The children of employees/contract employees of Hero FinCorp, Raman Kant Munjal Foundation, and Buddy4Study are ineligible to apply.

Scholarships ranging from INR 40,000 to INR 5,50,000 per year will be awarded to each scholar for three years to complete their education.

To apply for Hero FinCorp Raman Kant Munjal Scholarship, Follow the below steps

Steps:** Go to the link given above and Click on the ‘Apply Now’ button.** Login to Buddy4Study with your registered ID and navigate to the ‘Application Form Page’.** If you haven’t registered yet, please sign up on Buddy4Study using your email, mobile number, or Gmail account.** You will now be redirected to the ‘Raman Kant Munjal Scholarship 2026-27’ application form page.** Click on the ‘Start Application’ button to begin the application process.** Fill in the required details in the online application form.** Upload relevant documents.** Accept the ‘Terms and Conditions’ and click on ‘Preview’.** If all the details filled in by the applicant are correctly showing on the preview screen, click on the ‘Submit’ button to complete the application process.

** Recent passport-size photograph** PAN card and masked Aadhaar card of the parents** Proof of current academic enrolment (e.g., college ID card for the current academic year, demand receipt, bonafide certificate issued by the institute confirming current enrolment, or latest fee receipts)** Class 10th and 12th mark sheets** URL of the applicant’s LinkedIn profile** Annual parental income proof issued by a competent authority (ITR – all 7 pages reflecting all accounts / Income Certificate / Salary slip of salaried parents)** Bank account statements of the applicant’s parents** Bank account details (copy of passbook or cancelled cheque in the applicant’s name)** Affidavit (stating that all the documents provided by the applicant are true to their knowledge)

Last Date of Hero FinCorp Raman Kant Munjal Scholarship is 31st August 2026.Author : Jency

