https://www.scholarships.net.in/64830.html,"Organisation: Buddy4StudyScholarship Name: Buddy4Study College Admission Scholarship 2026-27Applicable For: Class 12th Passed StudentsScholarship Amount: 100% Tuition Fee WaiverLast Date: 31st July 2026Website:https://www.buddy4study.com/page/buddy4study-college-admission-scholarship

Table of Contents

The Buddy4Study College Admission Scholarship 2026-27 is an opportunity for Class 12-passed students (2026 or earlier) seeking admission to partner colleges. The scholarship is offered in the form of a tuition fee waiver. Students who have already secured admission are not eligible. If you have demonstrated academic excellence by scoring 75% or higher in your Class 12 examinations, and come from a family with an annual income of INR 8 lakh or less, this initiative welcomes you to apply.Last date of application is 31st July 2026.

** Open to students who have passed Class 12 in 2026 or earlier from any recognised board across India (CBSE, ICSE, or any Open/State Board) and are seeking admission to undergraduate programs.** Must have scored minimum 75% or above in class 12 board examinations** Annual family income must not exceed INR 8 lakh per annum

Selected candidates can become eligible for a tuition fee waiver covering up to 100% of their annual undergraduate program tuition fees at their enrolled institution.

To apply for Buddy4Study College Admission Scholarship, Follow the below steps

Steps:** Go to the link given above and Click on the ‘Apply Now’ button.** Log in to Buddy4Study using your registered ID to access the ‘Application form page’.** If you’re not registered, sign up on Buddy4Study using your Email, Mobile, or Google account.** You will be redirected to the “Buddy4Study College Admission Scholarship 2026-27” application form page.** Click the ‘Start Application’ button to begin the application process.** Fill in the required details in the online application form.** Upload the relevant documents.** Accept the ‘Terms and Conditions’ and click ‘Preview’.** If all the details are correct in the preview, click the ‘Submit’ button to complete your application.

** A recent Passport-sized photograph** Class 12 mark sheet** Annual Family/Parental Income proof (Form 16A/income certificate issued by government authority/BPL certificate/salary slips, etc.)** Admit card or result scorecard for national, state-level or university-level entrance examinations (if applicable).** Bank account details (copy of passbook or cancelled cheque in the applicant’s or parent’s name)

Last Date of Buddy4Study College Admission Scholarship is 31st July 2026.Author : Jency

