MBA in Luxury Brand Management:** Applicants must have completed a bachelor’s degree in any discipline from a recognised university/institution.** Final-year undergraduate students may also apply, subject to the admission norms of LCBS and submission of all required final academic documents before enrollment.** Total annual parental income must not exceed INR 8,00,000 from all sources.** Children of employees of Luxury Connect Business School and Buddy4Study are ineligible.

