https://www.scholarships.net.in/64839.html,"Organisation: Blue Star FoundationScholarship Name: Mohan T Advani Centennial Scholarship Programme 2026-27Applicable For: Diploma StudentsScholarship Amount: INR 40,000 or 75% of Academic FeeLast Date: 31st July 2026Website:https://www.buddy4study.com/page/mohan-t-advani-centennial-scholarship-programme

Table of Contents

The Mohan T Advani Centennial Scholarship Programme 2026-27 is a flagship CSR initiative by Blue Star Foundation, dedicated to breaking financial barriers for deserving students aspiring to build careers in engineering and architecture. The programme extends scholarship support of up to INR 1,00,000 to first and second-year students enrolled in undergraduate degree or diploma programmes across selected private and government institutions in India, enabling them to pursue quality technical education without financial constraints. Last date of application is 31st July 2026.

Related / Similar Scholarship:Mohan T Advani Centennial Scholarship 2026-27 For Engineering & Architecture Students

** First and second-year students enrolled in a diploma programme in architecture or engineering (including Mechanical, Electrical, Electronics, and Production Engineering; excluding Civil Engineering).** Applicants must demonstrate a good academic track record.** Must be enrolled in a college from the list approved by the Blue Star Foundation.** Annual family income from all sources must be less than INR 6 lakh (up to INR 10 lakh for West zone colleges subject to need; preference will be given to students with a total family income of INR 0–6 lakh.)** Children of Buddy4Study, Blue Star and Blue Star Foundation employees are not eligible.

Minimum academic score requirements:** First-year students: 70% in Class 10 or Class 12.** Second-year students: 75% (7.5 CGPA) in the first year.

Selected students will receive INR 40,000 or 75% of academic fee, whichever is lower.

To apply for Mohan T Advani Centennial Scholarship for Diploma Students, Follow the below steps

Steps:** Go to the link given above and Click on the ‘Apply Now’ button.** Login to Buddy4Study with your registered ID and navigate to the ‘Application Form Page’.** If you haven’t registered yet, please sign up on Buddy4Study using your email, mobile number, or Gmail account.** You will now be redirected to the ‘Mohan T Advani Centennial Scholarship Programme 2026-27’ application form page.** Click on the ‘Start Application’ button to begin the application process.** Fill in the required details in the online application form.** Upload relevant documents.** Accept the ‘Terms and Conditions’ and click on ‘Preview’.** If all the details filled in by the applicant are correctly showing on the preview screen, click on the ‘Submit’ button to complete the application process.

** Passport-size photograph of the applicant** Proof of admission (Admission letter/Institution ID Card, etc.) for enrollment in degree or diploma programs in architecture or engineering courses.** Payment receipts/Demand draft for educational expenses from colleges.** Mark sheets of the previous two classes/semesters/years (whichever is applicable).** Proof of identity/address (Voter ID Card, Driving License, etc.)

Proof of family income (any one of the following documents):** Income Tax Return Statement** Salary Slip** Form 16 (if salaried)** BPL/Ration Card** Income proof certificate signed by the concerned government authority** Certificate from the concerned authorities for individuals with income from agriculture, horticulture, and veterinary sources** Affidavit for orphans/single-parent children (where the family lost the earning member)

Last Date of Mohan T Advani Centennial Diploma Scholarship is 31st July 2026.Author : Jency

