The Luxury Connect Business School Scholarship Program 2026-27 is an initiative by Luxury Connect Business School which aims to support career-oriented students who wish to build a career in the luxury industry. Students who secure admission to Luxury Connect Business School in either of the following future-focused programs will be eligible to apply for scholarship support under the Luxury Connect Business School Scholarship Program 2026–27. Last date of application is 26th August 2026.

MBA in Luxury Brand Management:** Applicants must have completed a bachelor’s degree in any discipline from a recognised university/institution.** Final-year undergraduate students may also apply, subject to the admission norms of LCBS and submission of all required final academic documents before enrollment.** Total annual parental income must not exceed INR 8,00,000 from all sources.** Children of employees of Luxury Connect Business School and Buddy4Study are ineligible.

Advance Diploma in Luxury Retail Management + Client Experience:** Applicants must have completed Class 12 or equivalent from a recognised central/state board.** Must be currently pursuing a bachelor’s degree and studying in the second year or final year, or be a graduate.** Candidates with prior exposure to retail, hospitality, fashion, lifestyle, beauty, luxury sales, customer service, or related sectors are also encouraged to apply.** Total annual parental income must not exceed INR 8,00,000 from all sources.** Children of employees of Luxury Connect Business School and Buddy4Study are ineligible.

Students who secure admission to LCBS and fulfil the eligibility criteria will receive tuition fee waivers as per the scholarship matrix.

To apply for Luxury Connect Business School Scholarship, Follow the below steps

Steps:** Go to the link given above and Click on the ‘Apply Now’ button.** Log in to Buddy4Study using your registered ID to access the ‘Application form page’.** If you’re not registered, sign up on Buddy4Study using your Email, Mobile, or Google account.** You will be redirected to the “Luxury Connect Business School Scholarship Program 2026-27” application form page.** Click the ‘Start Application’ button to begin the application process.** Fill in the required details in the online application form.** Upload the relevant documents.** Accept the ‘Terms and Conditions’ and click ‘Preview’.** If all the details are correct in the preview, click the ‘Submit’ button to complete your application.

** Passport-size photograph** Proof of identity (Masked Aadhaar Card or any other valid government ID)** Class 10th maksheet** Class 12 marksheet** Graduation marksheet** Income certificate issued by a competent government authority (for scholarship applicants)** Disability certificate (if applicable for PwD applicants)** Death certificate (if applicable for single-parent children/orphans)

