** Recent passport-size photograph** PAN card and masked Aadhaar card of the parents** Proof of current academic enrolment (e.g., college ID card for the current academic year, demand receipt, bonafide certificate issued by the institute confirming current enrolment, or latest fee receipts)** Class 10th and 12th mark sheets** URL of the applicant’s LinkedIn profile** Annual parental income proof issued by a competent authority (ITR – all 7 pages reflecting all accounts / Income Certificate / Salary slip of salaried parents)** Bank account statements of the applicant’s parents** Bank account details (copy of passbook or cancelled cheque in the applicant’s name)** Affidavit (stating that all the documents provided by the applicant are true to their knowledge)

Last Date of Hero FinCorp Raman Kant Munjal Scholarship is 31st August 2026.Author : Jency

